---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = `NaS AI・NaS Advisory・法人向けAIセミナー｜Not a Square`;
const description = `株式会社Not a Square（NaS）の事業内容。AIの導入・実装から運用・定着まで伴走するNaS AI、法人向けAI顧問サービスのNaS Advisory、法人向けAIセミナーをご紹介します。`;
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} active="service" breadcrumb={[{ name: '事業内容' }]}>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="en hero-anim">SERVICE</div>
    <h1 class="hero-anim d1">事業内容</h1>
    <div class="breadcrumb hero-anim d2"><a href="/">ホーム</a> ／ 事業内容</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== SERVICE 01 ===== -->
<section id="service-01" class="sec" style="scroll-margin-top:90px">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center" class="grid-2">
      <div class="reveal-left">
        <span class="tag-pill">01</span>
        <h2 style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700;margin:16px 0 18px;line-height:1.5">NaS AI</h2>
        <div style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:2;margin:0 0 22px">
          <p style="margin:0 0 12px">AIエンジニアが現場に入り込み、業務改善を実装・定着・継続支援するサービスです。</p>
          <p style="margin:0">まず既存の業務環境とデータを整理し、AIを効果的に導入・運用できる基盤を構築。次に、業務や費用対効果に合ったAI導入・システム開発を行い、継続的な伴走・保守でその余白を定着させます。</p>
        </div>
        <ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>業務フロー監査</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>AIツール選定・実装</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>システム開発</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>伴走・保守・改善</li>
        </ul>
        <button id="flow-toggle" type="button" class="btn btn-ghost flow-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="flow">導入フローを見る <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal service-media">
        <img class="service-image" src="/uploads/service-01.png" alt="NaS AIによるAI導入支援">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="flow" class="flow-panel" hidden>
      <div class="flow-heading">
        <span>FLOW</span>
        <h3>NaS AI 導入の流れ</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-diagram">
        <div class="flow-axis"><span>導入フロー</span></div>
        <div class="flow-steps">
          <div class="flow-step flow-step-free" style="--c:var(--color-border);--t:var(--color-surface);--tc:var(--color-primary);--nc:var(--color-accent)">
            <div class="flow-bar">
              <span class="flow-num">01</span>
              <span class="flow-title">無料診断</span>
              <span class="flow-free-label">無料</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-desc">ヒアリングをもとに、AI活用の可能性を無料で診断します。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-paid">
            <div class="flow-step" style="--c:var(--color-primary);--t:var(--color-surface);--tc:#fff;--nc:var(--color-accent)">
              <div class="flow-bar"><span class="flow-num">02</span><span class="flow-title">初期診断</span></div>
              <div class="flow-desc">業務フローや課題を把握し、AI活用の余地を整理します。</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-step" style="--c:var(--color-primary);--t:var(--color-surface);--tc:#fff;--nc:var(--color-accent)">
              <div class="flow-bar"><span class="flow-num">03</span><span class="flow-title">基盤の整形</span></div>
              <div class="flow-desc">既存の業務環境とデータを整理し、AIを効果的に導入・運用できる基盤を構築します。</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-step" style="--c:var(--color-primary);--t:var(--color-surface);--tc:#fff;--nc:var(--color-accent)">
              <div class="flow-bar"><span class="flow-num">04</span><span class="flow-title">AI導入・システム開発</span></div>
              <div class="flow-desc">業務や費用対効果に合わせてAIを導入・システム開発を現場へ導入します。</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-step" style="--c:var(--color-primary);--t:var(--color-surface);--tc:#fff;--nc:var(--color-accent)">
              <div class="flow-bar"><span class="flow-num">05</span><span class="flow-title">運用・定着</span></div>
              <div class="flow-desc">AI導入後も、システムのアップデートや活用上の疑問に対応し、継続的な運用・定着を支援します。</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== SERVICE 02 ===== -->
<section id="service-02" class="sec sec-light" style="scroll-margin-top:90px">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center;direction:rtl" class="grid-2">
      <div class="reveal-left" style="direction:ltr">
        <span class="tag-pill">02</span>
        <h2 style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700;margin:16px 0 18px;line-height:1.5">NaS Advisory</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:2;margin:0 0 18px">AIについて継続的に相談したい企業に向けた、法人向けのAI顧問サービスです。月1回〜のオンライン相談とチャット相談を基本に、AI活用に関する疑問や最新情報、業務への取り入れ方について継続的にサポートします。支援内容は、お客様の課題や状況に応じて柔軟に調整します。</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>月1回のオンライン相談</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>回数制限なしのチャット相談</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>最新AI情報の共有</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>課題に応じた活用アドバイス</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal service-media" style="direction:ltr">
        <img class="service-image" src="/uploads/service-02.png" alt="NaS Advisoryによる法人向けAI顧問サービス">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== SERVICE 03 ===== -->
<section id="service-03" class="sec" style="scroll-margin-top:90px">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center" class="grid-2">
      <div class="reveal-left">
        <span class="tag-pill">03</span>
        <h2 style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700;margin:16px 0 18px;line-height:1.5">法人向けAIセミナー</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:2;margin:0 0 22px">AI活用を学べるセミナーを企画・開催します。経営者や現場担当者に向けて、専門用語に頼らず「明日から使える」AI活用の基礎から実践までを、事例を交えてお届けします。</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>経営者・実務者向けセミナー</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>AI活用の基礎〜実践</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>事例で学ぶワークショップ</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13.5px"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12l5 5L20 6"/></svg>最新動向のキャッチアップ</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal service-media">
        <img class="service-image" src="/uploads/service-03.png" alt="法人向けAIセミナー">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .service-media {
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .service-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .flow-toggle{margin-top:26px;cursor:pointer}
  .flow-toggle span{display:inline-block;margin-left:4px;transition:transform .25s}
  .flow-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span{transform:rotate(180deg)}
  .flow-panel[hidden]{display:none}
  .flow-panel{margin-top:54px;padding:34px 32px 36px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--color-surface);scroll-margin-top:90px}
  .flow-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto 24px}
  .flow-heading span{font-family:'Google Sans',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--color-accent)}
  .flow-heading h3{margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary)}
  .flow-diagram{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:stretch;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto}
  .flow-axis{flex:none;width:48px;background:var(--color-primary);border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - 24px),50% 100%,0 calc(100% - 24px));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px 0 36px}
  .flow-axis span{writing-mode:vertical-rl;text-orientation:upright;color:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.24em}
  .flow-steps{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;min-width:0}
  .flow-step{display:flex;align-items:stretch;min-height:78px}
  .flow-bar{flex:0 0 48%;min-width:0;background:var(--c);color:var(--tc,#fff);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 16px;clip-path:polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 24px) 0,100% 50%,calc(100% - 24px) 100%,0 100%);margin-right:-24px;position:relative;z-index:2}
  .flow-num{flex:none;width:44px;height:50px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;color:var(--nc,var(--c));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.02em;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(20,49,86,.12)}
  .flow-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.03em}
  .flow-desc{flex:1;min-width:0;background:var(--t);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:12px 20px 12px 40px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--color-primary)}
  .flow-free-label{margin-left:auto;flex:none;border:1px solid var(--color-accent);border-radius:999px;background:#fff;padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--color-primary)}
  .flow-paid{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1.5px solid var(--color-accent);border-radius:10px;padding:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.6)}
  @media(max-width:760px){
    .flow-panel{margin-top:40px;padding:26px 16px 20px;border-radius:12px}
    .flow-heading{margin-bottom:18px;gap:10px}
    .flow-heading h3{font-size:18px}
    .flow-diagram{flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .flow-axis{width:auto;height:40px;flex-direction:row;border-radius:6px;clip-path:polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 20px) 0,100% 50%,calc(100% - 20px) 100%,0 100%);padding:0 22px 0 16px;justify-content:flex-start}
    .flow-axis span{writing-mode:horizontal-tb;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:13px}
    .flow-step{flex-direction:column;min-height:0}
    .flow-bar{flex:none;margin-right:0;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - 14px),50% 100%,0 calc(100% - 14px));padding:12px 14px 22px;z-index:2}
    .flow-desc{padding:18px 14px 12px;margin-top:-8px}
    .flow-title{font-size:16px}
    .flow-paid{padding:7px;gap:7px;border-radius:9px}
    .flow-free-label{margin-right:12px}
  }

</style>

<script is:inline>
  (function(){
    var button = document.getElementById('flow-toggle');
    var panel = document.getElementById('flow');
    if (!button || !panel) return;
    button.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var willOpen = button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') !== 'true';
      button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(willOpen));
      panel.hidden = !willOpen;
      button.firstChild.textContent = willOpen ? '導入フローを閉じる ' : '導入フローを見る ';
      if (willOpen) {
        requestAnimationFrame(function(){ panel.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' }); });
      }
    });
  })();
</script>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal-left">
      <div class="ttl">御社に最適なプランをご提案します。</div>
      <div class="sub">まずは無料相談で、御社の可能性をお聞かせください。</div>
    </div>
    <div class="actions reveal">
      <a href="/download" class="btn btn-pill btn-pill-blue">
        資料をダウンロード
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v12M7 11l5 4 5-4M5 21h14"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/consultation" class="btn btn-pill btn-pill-warm">
        無料相談を申し込む
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
